  TextFields:
  - "CERES 12 Observatory\r<br>Route: WI-DC-22 / CER-12<br>Drop Point: Node 7F"
  - "A,\nI am sure you are seeing this but data is flooding the servers here. Its
    fun to see this work paying off. \n\nDid you figure out the Draco constellation
    yet? I left you a surprise, for when it\u2019s finished. Not much time left now\u2014the
    dragon is waking up.. \n \nOnly two stations left. I could be home by October!
    I can\u2019t wait to see you.  I know how lonely it can get at World\u2019s End.
    \n\nLove you,\n-E"
